image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">트리플렛 코드 탐구</p><p class=\"og-desc\">A와 C로 만들 수 있는 3염기 조합 (2×2×2 = 8가지) 초록 테두리는 이번 번역에서 실제로 읽힌 조합입니다. 여러 번 섞어 보면 아스파라진, 글루타민, 히스티딘, 트레오닌, 프롤린, 라이신이 모두 나</p><p class=\"og-host\">sedu21.github.io</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignLeft\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9838b1a3bd37699f664c1c77603944918abbd1df\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"310\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9838b1a3bd37699f664c1c77603944918abbd1df\" data-origin-width=\"450\" data-origin-height=\"447\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고&#160;</p><p>도입부의 도넛 이야기는</p><p>&#39;생명과학 이야기, 라이프사이언스&#39;를 입력하였습니다~</p><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table data-ke-type=\"table\" data-ke-align=\"alignLeft\" style=\"width: 100%;\" border=\"1\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dce4612d8c1c9c1f8de74e7c95578add917838eb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dce4612d8c1c9c1f8de74e7c95578add917838eb\" data-origin-width=\"1126\" data-origin-height=\"1544\"></div></td><td style=\"width: 50%;\"><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbae7dd9f1048ffd88fdffbd3dd795b27c9e7c77\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/dbae7dd9f1048ffd88fdffbd3dd795b27c9e7c77\" data-origin-width=\"1126\" data-origin-height=\"1501\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
